मत्स्थानि सर्वभूतानि न चाहं तेष्ववस्थित: ॥ ४ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":2587,\"bb\":2293,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/9/4/b2293/\",\"body_value\":\"mayā tatam idaṁ sarvaṁ
