na cāhaṁ teṣv avasthitaḥ\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":2588,\"bb\":2294,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/9/4/b2294/\",\"shadow_value\":\"mayā – by Me; tatam – pervaded; idam – this; sarvam – all; jagat – cosmic manifestation; avyakta-mūrtinā – by the unmanifested form; mat-sthāni – in Me; sarva-bhūtāni – all living entities; na – not; ca – also; aham – I; teṣu – in them; avasthitaḥ – situated.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"mayā\",\"translation\":\"by Me\"},{\"word\":\"tatam\",\"translation\":\"pervaded\"},{\"word\":\"idam\",\"translation\":\"this\"},{\"word\":\"sarvam\",\"translation\":\"all\"},{\"word\":\"jagat\",\"translation\":\"cosmic manifestation\"},{\"word\":\"avyakta-mūrtinā\",\"translation\":\"by the unmanifested form\"},{\"word\":\"mat-sthāni\",\"translation\":\"in Me\"},{\"word\":\"sarva-bhūtāni\",\"translation\":\"all living entities\"},{\"word\":\"na\",\"translation\":\"not\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"aham\",\"translation\":\"I\"},{\"word\":\"teṣu\",\"translation\":\"in them\"},{\"word\":\"avasthitaḥ\",\"translation\":\"situated\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":2589,\"bb\":2295,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/9/4/b2295/\",\"body_value\":\"By Me, in My unmanifested form, this entire universe is pervaded. All beings are in Me, but I am not in them.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":2590,\"bb\":2296,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/9/4/b2296/\",\"body_value\":\"The Supreme Personality of Godhead is not perceivable through the gross material senses. It is said,\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":2591,\"bb\":2297,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/9/4/b2297/\",\"body_value\":\"ataḥ śrī-kṛṣṇa-nāmādi
